{% macro team_record(record) -%}
{% if record.shown %}
### The Hands of the Creator

*The people who shaped this universe as the hand of its Creator, and what each of them did.*

{% for hand in record.hands %}
#### {{ hand.name }}{% if hand.former %} (former member){% endif %}

*{{ hand.tally }}{% if hand.epochs %} · {{ hand.epochs }}{% endif %}*

{% if hand.most %}
| Kind of act | Times |
|---|---|
{% for label, count in hand.most %}
| {{ label }} | {{ count }} |
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% for act in hand.acts %}
- **Epoch {{ act.epoch }}.** {{ act.label }}{% if act.undone %} *(undone{% if act.undone_by %} by {{ act.undone_by }}{% endif %})*{% endif %}{% if act.summary %} — {{ act.summary | plain }}{% endif %}{% if act.reason %}
  - Why: {{ act.reason | plain }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% if record.queue %}
#### Acts that waited for an age to end

| Act | By | Epoch | What became of it | Why | Result |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for line in record.queue %}
| {{ line.title }} | {{ line.author }} | {{ line.epoch }} | {{ line.status }} | {{ line.reason or "—" }} | {{ line.result or "—" }} |
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if record.proposals %}
#### Proposals to locked canon

| Act | Proposed by | Epoch | Decision | Decided by | Why | Note |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for line in record.proposals %}
| {{ line.title }} | {{ line.author }} | {{ line.epoch }} | {{ line.status }} | {{ line.decided_by or "—" }} | {{ line.reason or "—" }} | {{ line.note or "—" }} |
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
